Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,甲骨文的当家  真荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, the oracle of Oracle. What a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 见到你真高兴  - 打给我哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice to see you. - Call me. Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉里·金  - 拉里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Larry King. - Larry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了  我的朋友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, my people, my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧  托尼  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Tony. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很顺利  - 还不算糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Very mellow. - That wasn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这是什么  新款车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what we got here, the new model.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是随车附赠的吗  - 希望是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Does she come with the car? - I certainly hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是  - 玛西尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you are? - Marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.28,0:10:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,爱尔兰名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢  - 认识你很高兴  托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I like it. - Pleased to meet you, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我开  行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on the wheel. Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你是哪里人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.65,0:10:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 贝德福德  - 你来这里干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bedford. - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找你  - 是吗  你找到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looking for you. - Yeah? You found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你待会儿有什么事吗  - 送传票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you up to later? - Serving subpoenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他不喜欢被人递东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't like to be handed things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊  我的怪癖  - 我拿着就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I have a peeve. - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are hereby ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,明早9点出席参议院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to appear before the Senate Armed Services Committee
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,军事委员会的听证会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tomorrow morning at 9:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能出示下证件吗  - 你想看我的证件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I see a badge? - You wanna see the badge?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:10:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他喜欢证件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He likes the badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.93,0:11:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在还喜欢吗  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You still like it? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离华府多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far are we from D.C.?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,华府吗  250英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D.C.? 250 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,(华盛顿特区)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生  我们可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark, could we
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,继续之前的话题了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pick up now where we left off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生  请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么事  亲爱的  - 可以认真听吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, dear? - Can I have your attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否持有一件特制武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you or do you not possess a specialized weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没有  - 你没有吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I do not. - You do not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有  这要看你怎么定义"武器"一词了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not. Well, it depends on how you define the word "weapon."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钢铁侠武器  - 我的装置不符合这一描述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Iron Man weapon. - My device does not fit that description.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那你会怎么描述它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... How would you describe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我对它的描述就是它的准确定义  参议员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would describe it by defining it as what it is, Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是什么  - 高科技假肢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- As? - It's a high-tech prosthesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is... That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是我认为最合适的描述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's actually the most apt description I can make of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.27,0:11:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它是件武器  斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a weapon. It's a weapon, Mr. Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  如果你的优先考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, if your priority
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真是美国公民的幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was actually the well-being of the American citizen...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我的优先考虑是将钢铁侠武器交给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My priority is to get the iron Man weapon turned over to the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,美国人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people of the United States of America.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那你别想了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you can forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是钢铁侠  我和战衣是一体的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Iron Man. The suit and I are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:11:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,上交钢铁侠战衣就是交出我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To turn over the Iron Man suit would be to turn over myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这相当于卖身或卖淫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is tantamount to indentured servitude or prostitution,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.63,0:12:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这要看你是哪个州的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}depending on what state you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.49,0:12:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你别想拿到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  我不是专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm no expert...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,在卖淫方面吗  当然不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In prostitution? Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你可是参议员  拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a senator. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是武器专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no expert in weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们请来了一位武器专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have somebody here who is an expert on weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.64,0:12:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在传召贾斯汀·汉默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd now like to call Justin Hammer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在的主武器承包商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our current primary weapons contractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,请记录显示我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the record reflect that I observed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,汉默先生走进会场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Hammer entering the chamber,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,而我在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还会不会有真正的专家出席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if and when any actual expert will also be in attendance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,(贾斯汀·汉默  汉默工业执行总裁  国防部主系统承包商)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是专家  我得听你的  安托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no expert. I defer to you, Anthony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是金童嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the wonder boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,参议员  可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator, if I may.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我或许不是专家  但知道谁是最大的专家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may well not be an expert, but you know who was the expert?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.53,0:12:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸  霍华德·斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your dad. Howard Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们所有人的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really a father to us all,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也是军事工业时代之父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to the military-industrial age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.10,0:12:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说清楚  他可不是嬉皮士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just be clear. He was no flower child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,而是一只雄狮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都清楚本次听证会的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all know why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,过去六个月里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the last six months,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,安托尼·斯塔克创造了一把有无限可能的利剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anthony Stark has created a sword with untold possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但他却坚称那是块盾牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet he insists it's a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫我们躲在它后面  信任他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asks us to trust him as we cower behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望这让我感到安心  安托尼  真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I were comforted, Anthony, I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望离家时能不用锁门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to leave my door unlocked when I leave the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但这里不是加拿大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this ain't Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们生活在充满重大威胁的世界里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we live in a world of grave threats,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.74,0:13:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这些威胁  斯塔克先生并不总能预料到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}threats that Mr. Stark will not always be able to foresee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑钢铁侠  上帝保佑美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God bless Iron Man. God bless America.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,说得很好  汉默先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is well said, Mr. Hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,委员会现在要请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The committee would now like to invite
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·罗德中校进入会场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Colonel James Rhodes to the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,罗德  什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rhodey? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们  没想到会在这里见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, buddy. I didn't expect to see you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是我  我来了  认了吧  向前看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it's me, I'm here. Deal with it. Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.64,0:13:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 省省  - 好吧  我不说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drop it. - All right, I'll drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我面前有一份完整的钢铁侠武器报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have before me a complete report on the Iron Man weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,由罗德中校整理  中校  作为记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}compiled by Colonel Rhodes. And, Colonel, for the record,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,请读一下第57页第四段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can you please read page 57, paragraph four?
