Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看看真实情况如何吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let's see what's really going on.
