Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.59,0:16:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为大部分国家还要再研究个五年十年的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'd say most countries, five, 10 years away.
