Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去你妈  斯塔克先生  去你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you, Mr. Stark... Fuck you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.03,0:17:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,休会  今天休会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're adjourned. We're adjourned for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好  - 你真是讨喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - You've been a delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我是人民的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My bond is with the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我会为了自己乐意为这个国家效劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I will serve this great nation at the pleasure of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经证实了一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's one thing I've proven
