Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜您开幕仪式大获成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations on the opening ceremonies. They were such a success,
