Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而且容我说  终于能看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And may I say how refreshing it is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,您穿着衣服的视频真是令人耳目一新  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to finally see you in a video with your clothing on, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓  我要拆了你  泡了你的主板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to God I'll dismantle you. I'll soak your motherboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.20,0:18:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,把你改造成酒架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll turn you into a wine rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这恶心玩意我一天要喝多少盎司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many ounces a day of this gobbledegook am I supposed to drink?
