Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,检查钯含量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check palladium levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,血毒素含量  24%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood toxicity, 24%.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.55,0:18:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看来持续使用钢铁侠战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears that the continued use of the Iron Man suit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,加重了您的病情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is accelerating your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,又一个能源核耗尽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another core has been depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.75,0:18:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,老天  耗得真快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, they're running out quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经对所有已知元素进行了模拟计算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have run simulations on every known element,
