Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.67,0:39:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲  安东·万科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father. Anton Vanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.81,0:39:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我没听说过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.03,0:39:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲是你还活着的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father is the reason you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.12,0:39:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我还活着  是因为你有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reason I'm alive is 'cause you had a shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.58,0:39:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你抓住了  但没打中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you took it, you missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.80,0:39:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.79,0:39:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你可以让上帝流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can make God bleed,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.91,0:39:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,人们就不会再信奉他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the people will cease to believe in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.09,0:39:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,水里会有血  鲨鱼会围上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there will be blood in the water. And the sharks will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.44,0:39:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,其实  我只需要坐在这里等着瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth, all I have to do is sit here and watch
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.93,0:39:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看世界吞没你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the world will consume you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.68,0:39:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你要在哪里看世界吞没我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will you be watching the world consume me from?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.76,0:39:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,对了  囚室里  我会给你寄肥皂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. A prison cell. I'll send you a bar of soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.71,0:39:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼  你走之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Tony. Before you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.15,0:40:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,胸膛渗入钯  痛苦的死法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}palladium in the chest, painful way to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.99,0:40:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真是难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.68,0:40:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.47,0:40:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这证明灯神已被放了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It proves that the genie is out of the bottle
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.39,0:40:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而他完全不知道自己在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this man has no idea what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.91,0:40:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他把钢铁侠武器当做玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks of the Iron Man weapon as a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.97,0:40:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我参加的一场听证会上  斯塔克先生还坚称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was at a hearing where Mr. Stark, in fact, was adamant
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.93,0:40:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这种战衣其他地方不可能有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that these suits can't exist anywhere else,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.51,0:40:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别的地方没有  今后也不会有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't exist anywhere else, never will exist anywhere else,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.13,0:40:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,至少五到十年里都不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at least for five to 10 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.47,0:40:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,结果摩纳哥的事让我们意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and here we are in Monaco realizing,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.78,0:40:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"这种战衣已经有了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"These suits exist now."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.31,0:40:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,静音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.76,0:40:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他其实该给我颁发勋章的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He should be giving me a medal. That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.57,0:40:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么  - 你的机上餐点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that? - This is your in-flight meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.38,0:41:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你做的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just make that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.58,0:41:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  你以为我这三小时都干吗去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Where do you think I've been for three hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.98,0:41:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.38,0:41:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么事瞒着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what are you not telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.60,0:41:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我一点也不想回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to go home. At all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.82,0:41:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们取消我的生日派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's cancel my birthday party and...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.63,0:41:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在欧洲  去威尼斯玩玩吧  斯普莱力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in Europe. Let's go to Venice, Cipriani.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.28,0:41:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 记得吗  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remember? - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.55,0:41:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那里很适合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a great place to
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.85,0:41:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 健健康康的  - 我觉得现在时机不合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- be healthy. - I don't think this is the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.09,0:41:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们处于麻烦中呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in kind of a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.48,0:41:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  或许正因如此才最合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but maybe that's why it's the best time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.35,0:41:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为我们  - 我觉得作为执行总裁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 'Cause then we... - Well, I think as the CEO,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.27,0:41:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须露面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.48,0:41:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,作为执行总裁  你可以休假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As CEO, you are entitled to a leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.95,0:41:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 休假  - 公司度假村\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A leave? - A company retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.31,0:41:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 度假  在这样的时候  - 就去玩玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A retreat? During a time like this? - Just a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.96,0:41:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是提议给自己充充电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm just saying, to recharge our batteries
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.21,0:41:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把事情都考虑清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and figure it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.60,0:42:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不是每个人都是用电的  托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everybody runs on batteries, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.28,0:42:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,(土豆慢用)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.54,0:44:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.17,0:44:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.58,0:44:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太荣幸了  欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an absolute pleasure. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.77,0:44:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, goodness gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.90,0:44:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能给我的朋友解开手铐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we get the handcuffs off my friend here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.62,0:44:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅  抱歉  我是你的大粉丝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me, I'm sorry. I'm such a huge fan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.08,0:44:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想留下这样的第一印象的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want to make a first impression like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.91,0:44:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他又不是动物  拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not an animal. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.20,0:44:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是个人  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a human being. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.97,0:44:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.97,0:44:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫贾斯汀·汉默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Justin Hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.83,0:44:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟你做生意  请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to do some business with you. Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.85,0:44:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,开动吧  今天吃什么  杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dig in. What do we have today, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.39,0:45:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 意式生鲜鲑鱼片  - 意式生鲜鲑鱼片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have some salmon carpaccio. - Salmon carpaccio.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.22,0:45:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么  我们都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you want here, we got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.02,0:45:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢先吃甜点  叫人从旧金山送来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like my dessert first. I had this flown in from San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.05,0:45:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是意大利式的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Italian, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.20,0:45:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有机冰淇淋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Organic ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.03,0:45:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢吃甜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a sweet tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.63,0:45:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你是跟托尼·斯塔克有仇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently you do, too, for Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.03,0:45:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你在赛道上对托尼·斯塔克做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I saw you do to Tony Stark on that track,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.74,0:45:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你当着上帝和每个人的面去挑战他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how you stepped up to him in front of God and everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.58,0:45:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那简直...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.87,0:45:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你的作为触动了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You spoke to me with what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.53,0:45:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你知道  我会愿意倾听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know that you knew that I'd be listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.20,0:45:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我无法忍受你被转移去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is why I couldn't bear to have you shipped off
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.56,0:45:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,天晓得哪里  那多么浪费才能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to God knows where. It would have been such a waste of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.60,0:45:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但容我提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I might make a suggestion,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.93,0:45:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能就那么冲上去企图杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, you don't just go and try and kill the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.77,0:45:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,容我说  你要打击他的遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think, if I may, you go after his legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.25,0:45:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是你该扼杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.31,0:45:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我  我们在很多方面很像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and me, we are a lot alike in a lot of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.53,0:45:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我唯一的区别是  我有很多资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only difference between you and I is that I have resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.89,0:46:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得  容我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think, if I may,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.44,0:46:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要我的资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you need my resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.84,0:46:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一个背后支持你的资助人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone behind you, a benefactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.64,0:46:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我想来资助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to be that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.42,0:46:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.71,0:46:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你说英语吗  我可以去找个翻译\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you speak English? Because I can get a translator.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.84,0:46:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道  我刚刚说的你都听懂了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Have you been understanding everything I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.75,0:46:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.19,0:46:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好  哥们  - 很好  哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Very good, man. - Very good, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.63,0:46:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.49,0:46:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我要我的鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.97,0:46:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鸟  你要只鸟  - 我要我的鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A bird? You want a bird? - I want my bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.84,0:46:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以给你鸟  十只都没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can get you a bird. I can get you 10 birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.49,0:46:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我要我的鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.92,0:46:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  没什么是不可能的  我可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, okay. Nothing's impossible. I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.88,0:46:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这是...一只俄罗斯的鸟吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we talking about... ls this a bird back in Russia?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.48,0:46:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  但是公司的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but the fundamentals
