Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.88,1:02:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你会认识的最真实的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the realest person you're ever gonna meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.37,1:02:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真走运  这里的员工呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just my luck. Where's the staff here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.15,1:02:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那看上去不妙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not looking so good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.68,1:02:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我经历过更糟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.18,1:02:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已封锁周边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've secured the perimeter,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.23,1:02:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但恐怕维持不了很久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't think we should hold it for too much longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.76,1:02:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你被解雇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.56,1:02:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那不由你决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.20,1:02:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼  这位是罗曼诺夫特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, I want you to meet Agent Romanoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.78,1:02:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个神盾局影子特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a S.H.L.E.L.D. shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.61,1:02:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发现你生病后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we knew you were ill,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.56,1:02:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,弗瑞局长就派我潜到你身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was tasked to you by Director Fury.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.60,1:02:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我建议你道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.42,1:02:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近很忙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been very busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.95,1:02:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,让你女朋友当上执行总裁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made your girl your CEO,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.58,1:02:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,把东西都捐了出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're giving away all your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.45,1:02:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,让你的朋友穿着你的战衣飞走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let your friend fly away with your suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.45,1:02:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不了解...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if I didn't know better...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.91,1:02:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的确不了解  我没给他  是他自己夺的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know better. I didn't give it to him. He took it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.85,1:02:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他夺的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? He took it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.74,1:02:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是钢铁侠  他想夺就夺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Iron Man and he just took it'?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.04,1:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那位黑人兄弟走进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The little brother walked in there,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.97,1:02:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,扁了你一顿  然后夺了一件你的战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}kicked your ass and took your suit?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.12,1:02:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.01,1:03:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,根据斯塔克先生的数据库安保指导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, according to Mr. Stark's database security guidelines,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.89,1:03:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,有冗余规程防止未授权使用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there are redundancies to prevent unauthorized usage.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.62,1:03:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们想要什么  - 我们想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want from me? - What do we want from you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.34,1:03:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.38,1:03:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经成了个问题  而我得解决你这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have become a problem, a problem I have to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.14,1:03:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你怎么想  你不是我宇宙的中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contrary to your belief, you are not the center of my universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.42,1:03:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我在西南部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have bigger problems
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.25,1:03:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还有比你更大的问题要处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than you in the southwest region to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.52,1:03:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.81,1:03:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐  你们要挖了我的肾去卖吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, are you gonna steal my kidney and sell it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.64,1:03:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能坚持五秒别干什么坏事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you please not do anything awful for five seconds?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.33,1:03:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她刚对我做了什么  - 我们刚为你做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did she just do to me? - What did we just do for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.85,1:03:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那是二氧化锂  能缓解你的病症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's lithium dioxide. It's gonna take the edge off.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.35,1:03:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是想让你回去工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trying to get you back to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.27,1:03:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,给我几盒那玩意  我就没问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a couple of boxes of that. I'll be right as rain.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.40,1:03:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不能治愈  只能缓解症状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a cure, it just abates the symptoms.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.47,1:03:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去解决办法不会很简单的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't look like it's gonna be an easy fix.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.05,1:03:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我  我知道  我擅长这玩意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, I know. I'm good at this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.37,1:03:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在寻找合适的钯替代物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been looking for a suitable replacement for palladium.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.76,1:03:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我试过了每一种组合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've tried every combination,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.62,1:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,每一种已知元素的排列方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every permutation of every known element.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.36,1:03:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我要告诉你  你还没试全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm here to tell you, you haven't tried them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.19,1:04:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,特别快递\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special delivery.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.07,1:04:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,糖果电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Candygram.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.71,1:04:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿了东西给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.92,1:04:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.12,1:04:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把你的鸟拿来了  哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got you the bird, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.00,1:04:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我的鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not my bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.69,1:04:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  就是它啊  就是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean? That's the bird. This is the bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.13,1:04:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  为此动用了不少关系呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Pulled a lot of strings to get this bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.89,1:04:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这只鸟很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a great bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.28,1:04:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很美  - 从俄罗斯远道而来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a beautiful bird. - We got this all the way from Russia.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.98,1:04:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我说这不是我的鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, this not my bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.67,1:04:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  就算不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, listen, even if it's not the bird,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.49,1:04:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是只很美的鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, this is a gorgeous bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.60,1:04:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别对身外物那么执迷嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you know, look, don't get so attached to things.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.64,1:04:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,学会放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Learn to let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.12,1:04:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  杰克  那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Jack, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.20,1:04:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那...那不是头盔  那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that... That's not a helmet. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.85,1:05:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,伊凡  这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ivan... What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.70,1:05:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.22,1:05:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那是头盔吗  我看不像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a helmet? It doesn't look like a helmet to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.47,1:05:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意要怎么戴在脑袋上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How... How are you supposed to get a head in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.11,1:05:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 杰克  你的脑袋能放进去吗  - 不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jack, could you put your head in there? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.96,1:05:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,试试把脑袋放进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to put your head in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.24,1:05:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,试试吧  看能不能把脑袋放进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Try to put your head in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.15,1:05:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看  伊凡  他不能把脑袋放进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, Ivan? He can't put his head in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.02,1:05:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是头盔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's... That's not a helmet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.65,1:05:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而是脑袋  我得让人进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a head. I need to put a guy in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.39,1:05:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我得让战衣里能进个人  明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to fit a person in that suit. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.28,1:05:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 无人机更好  - 什么  无人机更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drone better. - What? Drone better?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.50,1:05:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么  为什么无人机更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is drone better? Why is drone better?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.18,1:05:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,人会制造问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People make problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.96,1:05:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我  无人机更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. Drone better.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.27,1:05:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,伊凡  我喜欢你  我给你把鸟拿来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ivan, you know, I like you. I got you the bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.28,1:05:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你说"没问题"的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said, "No problem."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.18,1:05:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你是跟我这么说的  你说"没问题"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you said to me. You said, "No problem."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.27,1:05:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要战衣  政府要战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I need suits. The government wants suits.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.17,1:05:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就像钢铁侠  懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Iron Man. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.28,1:05:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是人们要的  那会让他们开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what the people want. That's what's gonna make them happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.12,1:05:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.07,1:05:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别太执迷于身外物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get too attached to things.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.38,1:06:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,学会放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Learn to let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.30,1:06:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这些无人机最好能抢风头  伊凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These drones better steal the show, Ivan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.81,1:06:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗  最好让我震撼  伊凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand? Better rock my world, Ivan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.76,1:06:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.06,1:06:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这应该足以让参议院放过我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ought to get the Senate off my ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.73,1:06:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以用吗  - 完全能执行任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's functional? - Fully mission-capable.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.49,1:06:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  让汉默过来把它武器化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Get Hammer down here to weaponize it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.09,1:06:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.66,1:06:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,贾斯汀·汉默要在博览会上进行武器展示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justin Hammer's making a weapons presentation at the Expo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.75,1:06:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要用它进行介绍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd like this to introduce it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.36,1:06:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,长官  我不觉得博览会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I don't believe that the Expo...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.02,1:06:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,中校  得尽快让世界看到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel, the world needs to see this fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.94,1:06:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们必须做到  - 是  将军  但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've got to make this happen. - Yes, General, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.01,1:06:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这还是命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's also an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.58,1:06:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
