Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.45,1:23:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.40,1:23:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾  这无法合成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, it is impossible to synthesize.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.10,1:23:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,准备进行大型重装修\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready for a major remodel, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.01,1:23:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们又要做硬件了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're back in hardware mode.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.60,1:24:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听说你出过门  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I heard you broke the perimeter. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.94,1:24:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那都是三年前了  你去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was, like, three years ago. Where you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.94,1:24:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有事  - 我也有  还成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was doing some stuff. - Yeah, well, me, too, and it worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.11,1:24:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我这是在为主队忙活呢  科尔森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm playing for the home team, Coulson,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.38,1:24:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,为你和你的美毛怪兄弟们忙活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you and all your Fabulous Furry Freak Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.17,1:24:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你是要让我工作  还是找我麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, are you gonna let me work or break my balls?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.37,1:24:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这个怎么在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.41,1:24:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就是它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.67,1:24:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拿过来  - 你知道这是什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bring that to me. - You know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.58,1:24:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是我想成功需要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's exactly what I need to make this work.
