Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.86,1:25:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快点  使劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go. Put your knees into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.80,1:25:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  然后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go. And...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.78,1:25:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,放下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it. Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.87,1:25:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,完全水平  我忙呢  什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfectly level. I'm busy. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.08,1:25:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.29,1:25:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,再见  我被改派了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye. I've been reassigned.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.79,1:25:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,弗瑞局长要我去新墨西哥州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Director Fury wants me in New Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.51,1:25:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太棒了  迷人之地  - 据说是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fantastic. Land of Enchantment. - So I'm told.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.25,1:25:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 机密事宜吗  - 差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Secret stuff? - Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.55,1:25:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运  - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good luck. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.05,1:25:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 我们需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - We need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.65,1:25:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊  你都想不到  - 也没那么需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, more than you know. - Not that much.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.95,1:25:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,启动棱镜加速器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initializing prismatic accelerator.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.12,1:26:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,正在接近最大能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approaching maximum power.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.93,1:26:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.57,1:27:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.27,1:27:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你创造了新元素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have created a new element.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.72,1:27:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,先生  反应堆接受了改造能源核\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, the reactor has accepted the modified core.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.59,1:27:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我会开始进行诊断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will begin running diagnostics.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.96,1:27:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,伊凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Ivan.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.78,1:27:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟斯特恩参议员在一起呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got Senator Stern here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.72,1:27:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想过去一趟  看看无人机的设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought we'd swing over and look at some of the drone designs.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.91,1:27:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,无人机还没好呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The drone is not going to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.38,1:27:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没好呢  什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not ready? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.05,1:27:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以做展示  而不是演示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can make presentation, not demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.31,1:27:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么差别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is the difference?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.54,1:27:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,展示  不飞  不射击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Presentation. No fly. No shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.27,1:27:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, wait, wait. Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.42,1:27:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那你能让它们做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can you make them do?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.39,1:27:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是武器演示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, this is a weapons demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.51,1:28:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可以让它们致敬  - 致敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can make salute. - You can make salute?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.72,1:28:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思  "致敬"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "make salute"?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.41,1:28:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么意思  伊凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell does that mean, Ivan?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.58,1:28:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说好的可不是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not what we agreed to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.74,1:28:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你先是说能做战衣  然后又说能做无人机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised me suits and then you promised me drones.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.33,1:28:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一切都会没问题的  - 我想要的不是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, man, everything will be okay. - This is not what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.65,1:28:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这里呢  鸟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, there he is. It's the bird man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.29,1:28:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢那只鸟  是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you like the bird. Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.03,1:28:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的鸟吗  我都糊涂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that your bird? I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.26,1:28:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前说不是的  但现在看来关系好得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said it wasn't, but now it looks like you're best of pals.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.89,1:28:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢那只鸟  是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You love that bird, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.05,1:28:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧  把鸟拿走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Take the bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.88,1:28:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还有他的枕头  两个都拿走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take his pillows, too. Both of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.53,1:28:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还有鞋  拿走他的鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his shoes. Take his shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.62,1:29:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿走了你的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.59,1:29:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么感觉  难过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does that make you feel? Do you feel bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.34,1:29:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  因为那就是我的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. 'Cause that's how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.85,1:29:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有合同的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a contract.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.32,1:29:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我救你一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saved your life
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.04,1:29:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you give me suits.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.43,1:29:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我们的协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was our deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.43,1:29:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,而你没能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you did not deliver.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.04,1:29:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你是天才还是骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you're a genius or a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.00,1:29:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.86,1:29:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有很棒的东西恰好从天上掉进了我怀里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something really, really great fell into my lap.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.07,1:29:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,否则  我今晚只能指望你的本事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if it hadn't, I'd be at your mercy tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.47,1:29:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己弄到了一件斯塔克的装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I have a piece of Stark tech that I pimped out myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.65,1:29:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,现在  你价格过高的镇纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now your overpriced paperweights
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.26,1:29:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,会变成我的演示的陪衬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are gonna look like a backdrop to my demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.51,1:29:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白我想说什么了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you dig what I'm getting at here?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.74,1:29:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道你是否知道  但我不会说俄语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you know this, but I don't speak Russian!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.57,1:29:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna leave now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.54,1:30:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去博览会  或许还能享享艳福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go to the Expo. Maybe I'll even get laid.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.50,1:30:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,看到他们了吗  他们是你的保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see these guys? They're your babysitters.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.41,1:30:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好别惹他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are not to be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.33,1:30:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等我回来时  我们要重新商讨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I get back, we're gonna renegotiate
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.32,1:30:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们协议的条款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the terms of our agreement.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.28,1:30:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你要照协议办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're gonna make good on our arrangement
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.68,1:30:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,否则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because if you don't,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.87,1:30:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你会回到我找到你时的状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna be exactly what you were when I found you,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.49,1:30:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,做个死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.26,1:30:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got that?
