Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.36,1:30:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,呆呆  可以把这里收拾了吗  你真要我命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dummy, you, can we clean up this mess? You're killing me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.91,1:30:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我不...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.72,1:30:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,屏蔽号码来电  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming call with a blocked number, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.24,1:30:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我的通话权利被恢复了  太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My phone privilege is reinstated. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.32,1:30:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔森  迷人之地怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coulson. How's the Land of Enchantment?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.96,1:30:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼  你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.29,1:30:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我把转速翻倍了  - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I double cycle. - You what?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.36,1:30:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你说转速翻倍能量会更大  好建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me double cycle's more power. Good advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.56,1:30:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是都死了吗  还这么精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound pretty sprightly for a dead guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.28,1:30:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.39,1:31:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 追踪他  - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Trace him. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.84,1:31:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克之名的真正历史将被书写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the true history of Stark name will be written.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.80,1:31:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,贾维斯  他在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis, where is he?
